<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Word"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="ヒッチコック (Re-Recording)"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Hitchcock (Re-Recording)"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="ヒッチコック (Hitchcock) (Re-Recording)"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="ヒッチコック - Re-Recording"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="ヨルシカ"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Yorushika"/><amll:meta key="album" value="二人称"/><amll:meta key="album" value="second person"/><amll:meta key="isrc" value="JPPO02600141"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="3355479296"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1876728683"/><amll:meta key="qqMusicId" value="002doXqM27Cny1"/><amll:meta key="spotifyId" value="1kaGaPZjsbA0y3CFjqroAc"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="66893541"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="WTP016-CN"/><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><songwriters><songwriter>n-buna</songwriter></songwriters></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body dur="3:26.998"><div begin="0.687" end="3:26.998"><p begin="0.687" end="5.444" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0.687" end="0.811">「</span><span begin="0.811" end="1.135">雨</span><span begin="1.135" end="1.315">の</span><span begin="1.315" end="1.621">匂</span><span begin="1.621" end="1.866">い</span><span begin="1.866" end="2.050">に</span><span begin="2.050" end="2.371">懐</span><span begin="2.371" end="2.544">か</span><span begin="2.544" end="2.727">し</span><span begin="2.727" end="2.928">く</span><span begin="2.928" end="3.106">な</span><span begin="3.106" end="3.259">る</span><span begin="3.259" end="3.424">の</span><span begin="3.424" end="3.613">は</span><span begin="3.613" end="3.978">何</span><span begin="3.978" end="4.152">で</span><span begin="4.152" end="4.335">な</span><span begin="4.335" end="4.518">ん</span><span begin="4.518" end="4.706">で</span><span begin="4.706" end="4.809">し</span><span begin="4.809" end="4.912">ょ</span><span begin="4.913" end="4.982">う</span><span begin="4.982" end="6.357">か。</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">“为什么雨的气息 总会让人心生怀念呢</span></p><p begin="6.357" end="11.208" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="6.357" end="6.693">夏</span><span begin="6.693" end="6.861">が</span><span begin="6.861" end="7.189">近</span><span begin="7.189" end="7.437">づ</span><span begin="7.437" end="7.441">く</span><span begin="7.441" end="7.616">と</span><span begin="7.616" end="7.937">胸</span><span begin="7.937" end="8.121">が</span><span begin="8.121" end="8.504">騒</span><span begin="8.504" end="8.760">め</span><span begin="8.760" end="8.936">く</span><span begin="8.936" end="9.105">の</span><span begin="9.105" end="9.265">は</span><span begin="9.265" end="9.593">何</span><span begin="9.593" end="9.785">で</span><span begin="9.785" end="9.980">な</span><span begin="9.980" end="10.175">ん</span><span begin="10.176" end="10.345">で</span><span begin="10.345" end="10.448">し</span><span begin="10.449" end="10.552">ょ</span><span begin="10.552" end="10.655">う</span><span begin="10.656" end="11.619">か。</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">为什么一到了夏天 心中就总感觉静不下来呢</span></p><p begin="11.619" end="16.851" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="11.619" end="12.019">人</span><span begin="12.019" end="12.236">に</span><span begin="12.236" end="12.667">笑</span><span begin="12.667" end="12.859">わ</span><span begin="12.859" end="13.092">れ</span><span begin="13.092" end="13.291">た</span><span begin="13.291" end="13.492">ら</span><span begin="13.492" end="14.035">涙</span><span begin="14.035" end="14.227">が</span><span begin="14.227" end="14.411">出</span><span begin="14.411" end="14.596">る</span><span begin="14.596" end="14.771">の</span><span begin="14.771" end="14.947">は</span><span begin="14.947" end="15.243">何</span><span begin="15.243" end="15.443">で</span><span begin="15.443" end="15.623">な</span><span begin="15.623" end="15.803">ん</span><span begin="15.803" end="15.987">で</span><span begin="15.987" end="16.093">し</span><span begin="16.094" end="16.200">ょ</span><span begin="16.200" end="16.306">う</span><span begin="16.307" end="17.597">か。</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">为什么一被人嘲笑 就总是会掉眼泪呢</span></p><p begin="17.597" end="22.443" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="17.597" end="17.757">そ</span><span begin="17.757" end="17.965">れ</span><span begin="17.965" end="18.173">で</span><span begin="18.173" end="18.413">も</span><span begin="18.413" end="18.630">い</span><span begin="18.630" end="18.829">つ</span><span begin="18.829" end="19.013">か</span><span begin="19.013" end="19.389">報</span><span begin="19.389" end="19.573">わ</span><span begin="19.573" end="19.765">れ</span><span begin="19.765" end="19.804">る</span><span begin="19.804" end="19.980">か</span><span begin="19.980" end="20.172">ら</span><span begin="20.172" end="20.308">と</span><span begin="20.308" end="20.701">思</span><span begin="20.701" end="20.948">え</span><span begin="20.948" end="21.140">ば</span><span begin="21.140" end="21.254">い</span><span begin="21.255" end="21.369">い</span><span begin="21.369" end="21.483">ん</span><span begin="21.644" end="21.748">し</span><span begin="21.748" end="21.852">ょ</span><span begin="21.852" end="21.956">う</span><span begin="21.956" end="22.627">か。」</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">就算这样 我只要相信这一切都会有所回报就够了吗”</span></p><p begin="22.867" end="28.363" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="22.867" end="23.043">さ</span><span begin="23.043" end="23.219">よ</span><span begin="23.219" end="23.395">な</span><span begin="23.395" end="23.551">ら</span><span begin="23.551" end="23.707">っ</span><span begin="23.707" end="23.915">て</span><span begin="23.915" end="24.467">言</span><span begin="24.467" end="24.699">葉</span><span begin="24.699" end="25.411">で</span><span begin="25.698" end="25.822">こ</span><span begin="25.823" end="25.947">ん</span><span begin="25.947" end="26.155">な</span><span begin="26.155" end="26.507">に</span><span begin="26.507" end="27.035">胸</span><span begin="27.035" end="27.227">を</span><span begin="27.227" end="27.411">裂</span><span begin="27.411" end="27.611">い</span><span begin="27.611" end="28.363">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">那句道别 原来如此撕心裂肺</span></p><p begin="28.531" end="36.484" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="28.531" end="28.843">今</span><span begin="28.843" end="29.026">も</span><span begin="29.026" end="29.190">た</span><span begin="29.190" end="29.354">っ</span><span begin="29.355" end="29.555">た</span><span begin="29.555" end="29.915">数</span><span begin="29.915" end="30.235">瞬</span><span begin="30.235" end="30.893">の</span><span begin="30.893" end="31.268">夕</span><span begin="31.268" end="31.461">焼</span><span begin="31.461" end="31.685">け</span><span begin="31.685" end="33.285">に</span><span begin="34.565" end="34.892">足</span><span begin="34.892" end="35.052">が</span><span begin="35.052" end="35.212">止</span><span begin="35.212" end="35.352">ま</span><span begin="35.353" end="35.493">っ</span><span begin="35.493" end="35.685">て</span><span begin="35.685" end="35.877">い</span><span begin="35.878" end="36.484">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">时至今日 我依然会为了那转瞬即逝的夕阳 驻足不前</span></p><p begin="36.701" end="39.325" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="36.701" end="36.852">「</span><span begin="36.852" end="37.092">先</span><span begin="37.092" end="37.405">生、</span><span begin="37.405" end="37.725">人</span><span begin="37.725" end="38.084">生</span><span begin="38.084" end="38.452">相</span><span begin="38.452" end="38.836">談</span><span begin="38.836" end="39.141">で</span><span begin="39.141" end="39.580">す。</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">“老师、关于人生 我有不明白的地方</span></p><p begin="39.580" end="42.076" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="39.580" end="39.748">こ</span><span begin="39.748" end="39.917">の</span><span begin="39.917" end="40.276">先</span><span begin="40.276" end="40.428">ど</span><span begin="40.429" end="40.581">う</span><span begin="40.581" end="40.837">な</span><span begin="40.837" end="41.012">ら</span><span begin="41.012" end="41.349">楽</span><span begin="41.349" end="41.525">で</span><span begin="41.525" end="41.716">す</span><span begin="41.716" end="42.324">か。</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">今后该怎么样 才能活的轻松呢</span></p><p begin="42.324" end="46.788" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="42.324" end="42.508">そ</span><span begin="42.509" end="42.693">ん</span><span begin="42.693" end="42.884">な</span><span begin="42.884" end="43.085">の</span><span begin="43.085" end="43.460">誰</span><span begin="43.460" end="43.644">も</span><span begin="43.644" end="43.844">わ</span><span begin="43.844" end="44.029">か</span><span begin="44.029" end="44.213">り</span><span begin="44.213" end="44.397">は</span><span begin="44.397" end="44.588">し</span><span begin="44.588" end="44.772">な</span><span begin="44.772" end="44.972">い</span><span begin="44.972" end="45.112">よ</span><span begin="45.112" end="45.288">な</span><span begin="45.288" end="45.464">ん</span><span begin="45.464" end="45.671">て</span><span begin="45.671" end="45.863">言</span><span begin="45.863" end="46.040">わ</span><span begin="46.040" end="46.215">れ</span><span begin="46.215" end="46.519">ま</span><span begin="46.519" end="46.680">す</span><span begin="46.680" end="47.011">か。</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">你会告诉我 这种问题 没有人知道答案吗</span></p><p begin="47.011" end="50.522" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="47.011" end="47.211">ほ</span><span begin="47.211" end="47.940">ら、</span><span begin="47.940" end="48.299">苦</span><span begin="48.299" end="48.481">し</span><span begin="48.481" end="48.705">さ</span><span begin="48.705" end="48.873">な</span><span begin="48.873" end="49.041">ん</span><span begin="49.041" end="49.233">て</span><span begin="49.233" end="49.425">欲</span><span begin="49.425" end="49.593">し</span><span begin="49.593" end="49.761">い</span><span begin="49.761" end="49.954">わ</span><span begin="49.954" end="50.137">け</span><span begin="50.137" end="50.473">な</span><span begin="50.473" end="50.793">い。</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">你瞧、我也不是想让自己难受</span></p><p begin="50.793" end="53.508" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="50.793" end="51.194">何</span><span begin="51.194" end="51.393">も</span><span begin="51.393" end="51.593">し</span><span begin="51.593" end="51.794">な</span><span begin="51.794" end="51.977">い</span><span begin="51.977" end="52.185">で</span><span begin="52.185" end="52.361">生</span><span begin="52.361" end="52.545">き</span><span begin="52.545" end="52.804">て</span><span begin="52.804" end="53.003">い</span><span begin="53.003" end="53.283">た</span><span begin="53.283" end="53.558">い。</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我只是想浑浑噩噩无所作为地活下去</span></p><p begin="53.508" end="57.219" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="53.508" end="53.924">青</span><span begin="53.924" end="54.316">空</span><span begin="54.316" end="54.477">だ</span><span begin="54.477" end="54.700">け</span><span begin="54.700" end="54.908">が</span><span begin="54.908" end="55.101">見</span><span begin="55.101" end="55.292">た</span><span begin="55.292" end="55.508">い</span><span begin="55.508" end="55.741">の</span><span begin="55.741" end="55.836">は</span><span begin="55.836" end="56.172">我</span><span begin="56.172" end="56.549">儘</span><span begin="56.549" end="56.796">で</span><span begin="56.796" end="56.940">す</span><span begin="56.940" end="57.364">か。」</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">只想看着蓝天 难道也算是一种任性吗”</span></p><p begin="1:11.075" end="1:16.064" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:11.075" end="1:11.323">「</span><span begin="1:11.323" end="1:11.700">胸</span><span begin="1:11.700" end="1:11.883">が</span><span begin="1:11.883" end="1:12.164">痛</span><span begin="1:12.165" end="1:12.399">ん</span><span begin="1:12.399" end="1:12.559">で</span><span begin="1:12.559" end="1:12.783">も</span><span begin="1:12.783" end="1:13.127">嘘</span><span begin="1:13.127" end="1:13.295">が</span><span begin="1:13.295" end="1:13.487">つ</span><span begin="1:13.487" end="1:13.743">け</span><span begin="1:13.743" end="1:13.904">る</span><span begin="1:13.904" end="1:14.049">の</span><span begin="1:14.049" end="1:14.223">は</span><span begin="1:14.223" end="1:14.527">何</span><span begin="1:14.527" end="1:14.735">で</span><span begin="1:14.735" end="1:14.919">な</span><span begin="1:14.919" end="1:15.103">ん</span><span begin="1:15.103" end="1:15.279">で</span><span begin="1:15.279" end="1:15.391">し</span><span begin="1:15.391" end="1:15.503">ょ</span><span begin="1:15.503" end="1:15.615">う</span><span begin="1:15.615" end="1:16.823">か。</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">“为什么心里都这么痛了 还是能照常撒下谎言呢</span></p><p begin="1:16.823" end="1:21.617" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:16.823" end="1:17.141">悪</span><span begin="1:17.141" end="1:17.318">い</span><span begin="1:17.318" end="1:17.666">人</span><span begin="1:17.666" end="1:17.838">ば</span><span begin="1:17.838" end="1:18.020">か</span><span begin="1:18.020" end="1:18.228">り</span><span begin="1:18.228" end="1:18.401">が</span><span begin="1:18.401" end="1:18.726">得</span><span begin="1:18.726" end="1:18.911">を</span><span begin="1:18.911" end="1:19.097">し</span><span begin="1:19.097" end="1:19.309">て</span><span begin="1:19.309" end="1:19.480">る</span><span begin="1:19.480" end="1:19.645">の</span><span begin="1:19.645" end="1:19.832">は</span><span begin="1:19.832" end="1:20.158">何</span><span begin="1:20.158" end="1:20.380">で</span><span begin="1:20.380" end="1:20.545">な</span><span begin="1:20.545" end="1:20.710">ん</span><span begin="1:20.710" end="1:20.891">で</span><span begin="1:20.891" end="1:21.002">し</span><span begin="1:21.003" end="1:21.114">ょ</span><span begin="1:21.114" end="1:21.244">う</span><span begin="1:21.245" end="1:22.425">か。</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">为什么坏人们 反而总能得到好处呢</span></p><p begin="1:22.425" end="1:27.555" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:22.425" end="1:22.953">幸</span><span begin="1:22.953" end="1:23.129">せ</span><span begin="1:23.129" end="1:23.313">の</span><span begin="1:23.313" end="1:23.513">文</span><span begin="1:23.513" end="1:23.697">字</span><span begin="1:23.697" end="1:23.989">が</span><span begin="1:23.989" end="1:24.406">￥</span><span begin="1:24.406" end="1:24.618">を</span><span begin="1:24.618" end="1:25.018">含</span><span begin="1:25.018" end="1:25.203">む</span><span begin="1:25.203" end="1:25.378">の</span><span begin="1:25.378" end="1:25.579">は</span><span begin="1:25.579" end="1:25.818">何</span><span begin="1:25.818" end="1:26.010">で</span><span begin="1:26.010" end="1:26.194">な</span><span begin="1:26.194" end="1:26.378">ん</span><span begin="1:26.378" end="1:26.538">で</span><span begin="1:26.538" end="1:26.647">し</span><span begin="1:26.647" end="1:26.756">ょ</span><span begin="1:26.757" end="1:26.866">う</span><span begin="1:26.866" end="1:28.069">か。</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">为什么幸福的幸字中间 居然藏着￥这一符号呢</span></p><p begin="1:28.069" end="1:33.028" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:28.069" end="1:28.509">一</span><span begin="1:28.509" end="1:28.701">つ</span><span begin="1:28.701" end="1:29.007">線</span><span begin="1:29.008" end="1:29.168">を</span><span begin="1:29.168" end="1:29.352">抜</span><span begin="1:29.352" end="1:29.529">け</span><span begin="1:29.529" end="1:29.712">ば</span><span begin="1:29.712" end="1:30.064">辛</span><span begin="1:30.064" end="1:30.225">さ</span><span begin="1:30.225" end="1:30.409">に</span><span begin="1:30.409" end="1:30.553">な</span><span begin="1:30.553" end="1:30.728">る</span><span begin="1:30.728" end="1:30.889">の</span><span begin="1:30.889" end="1:31.108">は</span><span begin="1:31.108" end="1:31.292">わ</span><span begin="1:31.292" end="1:31.483">ざ</span><span begin="1:31.483" end="1:31.683">と</span><span begin="1:31.683" end="1:31.859">な</span><span begin="1:31.859" end="1:32.035">ん</span><span begin="1:32.035" end="1:32.211">で</span><span begin="1:32.211" end="1:32.317">し</span><span begin="1:32.318" end="1:32.424">ょ</span><span begin="1:32.424" end="1:32.530">う</span><span begin="1:32.531" end="1:33.187">か。」</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">而这幸字去掉一横 就会变成辛苦的辛字 难道是故意的吗”</span></p><p begin="1:33.370" end="1:38.754" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:33.370" end="1:33.762">青</span><span begin="1:33.762" end="1:34.109">春</span><span begin="1:34.109" end="1:34.224">っ</span><span begin="1:34.225" end="1:34.474">て</span><span begin="1:34.474" end="1:34.865">値</span><span begin="1:34.865" end="1:35.305">札</span><span begin="1:35.305" end="1:35.929">が</span><span begin="1:36.225" end="1:36.426">背</span><span begin="1:36.426" end="1:36.802">中</span><span begin="1:36.802" end="1:37.137">に</span><span begin="1:37.137" end="1:37.361">貼</span><span begin="1:37.361" end="1:37.706">ら</span><span begin="1:37.706" end="1:37.881">れ</span><span begin="1:37.881" end="1:38.029">て</span><span begin="1:38.029" end="1:38.177">い</span><span begin="1:38.177" end="1:38.754">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">名为青春的标签 贴在了背后</span></p><p begin="1:39.046" end="1:47.128" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:39.046" end="1:39.226">ヒ</span><span begin="1:39.226" end="1:39.406">ッ</span><span begin="1:39.407" end="1:39.598">チ</span><span begin="1:39.598" end="1:39.742">コ</span><span begin="1:39.742" end="1:39.886">ッ</span><span begin="1:39.886" end="1:40.111">ク</span><span begin="1:40.111" end="1:40.447">み</span><span begin="1:40.447" end="1:40.647">た</span><span begin="1:40.647" e