>痛</span><span begin="1:51.870" end="1:51.970">い</span><span begin="1:51.970" end="1:51.974">ん</span><span begin="1:51.974" end="1:52.118">で</span><span begin="1:52.118" end="1:52.342">す</span><span begin="1:52.342" end="1:52.976">よ。</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">单单是活着 都已经痛彻心扉了</span></p><p begin="1:52.976" end="1:57.536" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:52.976" end="1:53.120">ニ</span><span begin="1:53.120" end="1:53.264">ー</span><span begin="1:53.264" end="1:53.364">チ</span><span begin="1:53.364" end="1:53.464">ェ</span><span begin="1:53.464" end="1:53.688">も</span><span begin="1:53.688" end="1:53.896">フ</span><span begin="1:53.896" end="1:54.088">ロ</span><span begin="1:54.088" end="1:54.272">イ</span><span begin="1:54.272" end="1:54.489">ト</span><span begin="1:54.489" end="1:54.575">も</span><span begin="1:54.575" end="1:54.759">こ</span><span begin="1:54.759" end="1:54.959">の</span><span begin="1:54.959" end="1:55.344">穴</span><span begin="1:55.344" end="1:55.536">の</span><span begin="1:55.536" end="1:55.728">埋</span><span begin="1:55.728" end="1:55.912">め</span><span begin="1:55.912" end="1:56.280">方</span><span begin="1:56.280" end="1:56.464">は</span><span begin="1:56.464" end="1:56.648">書</span><span begin="1:56.648" end="1:56.745">か</span><span begin="1:56.745" end="1:56.897">な</span><span begin="1:56.897" end="1:57.013">い</span><span begin="1:57.014" end="1:57.130">ん</span><span begin="1:57.130" end="1:57.586">だ。</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">尼采和佛洛依德 都没有写 该如何填上这块空洞啊</span></p><p begin="1:57.536" end="2:01.279" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:57.536" end="1:57.777">た</span><span begin="1:57.777" end="1:58.321">だ</span><span begin="1:58.601" end="1:58.985">夏</span><span begin="1:58.985" end="1:59.176">の</span><span begin="1:59.176" end="1:59.584">匂</span><span begin="1:59.584" end="1:59.769">い</span><span begin="1:59.769" end="1:59.960">に</span><span begin="1:59.960" end="2:00.144">目</spa