nd="2:27.266">の</span><span begin="2:27.266" end="2:27.442">も</span><span begin="2:27.442" end="2:27.849">嫌</span><span begin="2:27.849" end="2:28.050">に</span><span begin="2:28.050" end="2:28.305">な</span><span begin="2:28.305" end="2:28.374">り</span><span begin="2:28.374" end="2:28.558">ま</span><span begin="2:28.558" end="2:28.711">し</span><span begin="2:28.711" end="2:29.967">た。</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">就连鲜花凋零的刹那 都被明码标价 我实在是厌倦了啊</span></p><p begin="2:29.967" end="2:33.374" itunes:key="L28" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:29.967" end="2:30.375">先</span><span begin="2:30.375" end="2:30.702">生</span><span begin="2:30.702" end="2:30.974">の</span><span begin="2:30.974" end="2:31.391">夢</span><span begin="2:31.391" end="2:31.513">は</span><span begin="2:31.513" end="2:31.818">何</span><span begin="2:31.818" end="2:31.974">だ</span><span begin="2:31.974" end="2:32.130">っ</span><span begin="2:32.130" end="2:32.254">た</span><span begin="2:32.254" end="2:32.502">ん</span><span begin="2:32.502" end="2:32.686">で</span><span begin="2:32.686" end="2:32.919">す</span><span begin="2:32.919" end="2:35.397">か。</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">老师 你的梦想又是什么呢</span></p><p begin="2:35.397" end="2:38.851" itunes:key="L29" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:35.397" end="2:35.661">大</span><span begin="2:35.661" end="2:35.925">人</span><span begin="2:35.925" end="2:36.117">に</span><span begin="2:36.117" end="2:36.294">な</span><span begin="2:36.294" end="2:36.462">る</span><span begin="2:36.462" end="2:36.611">と</span><span begin="2:36.611" end="2:36.963">忘</span><span begin="2:36.963" end="2:37.147">れ</span><span begin="2:37.147" end="2:37.230">ち</span><span begin="2:37.230" end="2:37.313">ゃ</span><span begin="2:37.314" end="2:37.507">う</span><span begin="2:37.507" end="2:37.707">も</span><span begin="2:37.707" end="2:37.883">の</span><span begin="2:37.883" end="2:38.047">な</span><span begin="2:38.047" end="2:38.211">ん</span><span begin="2:38.211" end="2:38.507">で</span><span begin="2:38.507" end="2:38.659">す</span><span begin="2:38.659" end="2:39.042">か。」</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">难道是那种长大了之后 就忘掉了的梦想吗”</span></p><p begin="2:40.947" end="2:43.546" itunes:key="L30" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:40.947" end="2:41.155">「</span><span begin="2:41.155" end="2:41.330">先</span><span begin="2:41.330" end="2:41.619">生、</span><span begin="2:41.619" end="2:41.955">人</span><span begin="2:41.955" end="2:42.338">生</span><span begin="2:42.338" end="2:42.691">相</span><span begin="2:42.691" end="2:43.036">談</span><span begin="2:43.036" end="2:43.363">で</span><span begin="2:43.363" end="2:43.763">す。</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">“老师、关于人生 我有不明白的地方</span></p><p begin="2:43.763" end="2:46.323" itunes:key="L31" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:43.763" end="2:43.947">こ</span><span begin="2:43.947" end="2:44.130">の</span><span begin="2:44.130" end="2:44.490">先</span><span begin="2:44.490" end="2:44.638">ど</span><span begin="2:44.638" end="2:44.786">う</span><span begin="2:44.786" end="2:44.987">な</span><span begin="2:44.987" end="2:45.170">ら</span><span begin="2:45.170" end="2:45.539">楽</span><span begin="2:45.539" end="2:45.715">で</span><span begin="2:45.715" end="2:45.914">す</span><span begin="2:45.914" end="2:46.587">か。</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">今后该怎么样 才能活的轻松呢</span></p><p begin="2:46.587" end="2:51.191" itunes:key="L32" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:46.587" end="2:47.130">涙</span><span begin="2:47.130" end="2:47.330">が</span><span begin="2:47.330" end="2:47.730">人</span><span begin="2:47.730" end="2:47.930">を</span><span begin="2:47.930" end="2:48.306">強</span><span begin="2:48.306" end="2:48.391">く</span><span begin="2:48.391" end="2:48.559">す</span><span begin="2:48.559" end="2:48.744">る</span><span begin="2:48.744" end="2:48.927">な</span><span begin="2:48.927" end="2:49.110">ん</span><span begin="2:49.111" end="2:49.328">て</span><span begin="2:49.328" end="2:49.672">全</span><span begin="2:49.672" end="2:49.855">部</span><span begin="2:49.855" end="2:50.047">詭</span><span begin="2:50.047" end="2:50.389">弁</span><span begin="2:50.389" end="2:50.541">で</span><span begin="2:50.541" end="2:50.749">し</span><span begin="2:50.749" end="2:51.241">た。</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">所谓泪水能让人更加强大 统统都是诡辩啊</span></p><p begin="2:51.191" end="2:54.885" itunes:key="L33" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:51.191" end="2:51.661">あ</span><span begin="2:51.661" end="2:52.280">ぁ、</span><span begin="2:52.280" end="2:52.435">こ</span><span begin="2:52.435" end="2:52.596">の</span><span begin="2:52.596" end="2:52.964">先</span><span begin="2:52.964" end="2:53.131">ど</span><span begin="2:53.132" end="2:53.299">う</span><span begin="2:53.299" end="2:53.489">で</span><span begin="2:53.489" end="2:53.695">も</span><span begin="2:53.695" end="2:53.868">い</span><span begin="2:53.868" end="2:54.016">い</span><span begin="2:54.016" end="2:54.205">わ</span><span begin="2:54.205" end="2:54.380">け</span><span begin="2:54.380" end="2:54.533">な</span><span begin="2:54.533" end="2:54.720">く</span><span begin="2:54.720" end="2:55.074">て、</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">啊啊、未来会如何 怎么可能真的无所谓</span></p><p begin="2:55.074" end="2:57.572" itunes:key="L34" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:55.074" end="2:55.386">現</span><span begin="2:55.386" end="2:55.745">実</span><span begin="2:55.745" end="2:55.946">だ</span><span begin="2:55.946" end="2:56.130">け</span><span begin="2:56.130" end="2:56.297">が</span><span begin="2:56.297" end="2:56.481">ち</span><span begin="2:56.481" end="2:56.714">ら</span><span begin="2:56.714" end="2:56.906">つ</span><span begin="2:56.906" end="2:57.081">い</span><span begin="2:57.081" end="2:57.821">て、</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">但现实却总飘忽不定</span></p><p begin="2:57.821" end="2:59.455" itunes:key="L35" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:57.821" end="2:58.205">夏</span><span begin="2:58.205" end="2:58.389">が</span><span begin="2:58.389" end="2:58.839">遠</span><span begin="2:58.839" end="2:59.015">く</span><span begin="2:59.015" end="3:00.767">て。</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">夏天也渐渐远去了</span></p><p begin="3:00.767" end="3:03.303" itunes:key="L36" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:00.767" end="3:00.983">こ</span><span begin="3:00.983" end="3:01.191">れ</span><span begin="3:01.191" end="3:01.359">で</span><span begin="3:01.359" end="3:01.455">も</span><span begin="3:01.455" end="3:01.767">本</span><span begin="3:01.767" end="3:01.975">当</span><span begin="3:01.975" end="3:02.079">に</span><span begin="3:02.079" end="3:02.210">い</span><span begin="3:02.210" end="3:02.341">い</span><span begin="3:02.341" end="3:02.472">ん</span><span begin="3:02.472" end="3:02.647">で</span><span begin="3:02.647" end="3:02.887">す</span><span begin="3:02.887" end="3:03.535">か。</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">这样真的好吗</span></p><p begin="3:03.535" end="3:06.176" itunes:key="L37" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:03.535" end="3:03.736">こ</span><span begin="3:03.736" end="3:03.920">の</span><span begin="3:03.920" end="3:04.095">ま</span><span begin="3:04.095" end="3:04.295">ま</span><span begin="3:04.295" end="3:04.495">生</span><span begin="3:04.495" end="3:04.680">き</span><span begin="3:04.680" end="3:04.864">て</span><span begin="3:04.864" end="3:05.056">も</span><span begin="3:05.056" end="3:05.165">い</span><span begin="3:05.165" end="3:05.274">い</span><span begin="3:05.275" end="3:05.384">ん</span><span begin="3:05.384" end="3:05.665">で</span><span begin="3:05.665" end="3:05.824">す</span><span begin="3:05.824" end="3:06.353">か。</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我能接受 就这么活下去吗</span></p><p begin="3:06.353" end="3:11.010" itunes:key="L38" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:06.353" end="3:06.533">そ</span><span begin="3:06.533" end="3:06.713">ん</span><span begin="3:06.713" end="3:06.914">な</span><span begin="3:06.914" end="3:07.122">の</span><span begin="3:07.122" e